# Reading the removers' master list in the cellar. Two beats: what it is, and
# the one line on it that has Lino's building in it. The flag it raises is what
# lets Cesare fill in the notification later — knowledge crossing between two
# characters who never meet, which objects cannot do in this game.

uid baggaseqmanif1

say  SEQ_CELLAR_MANIFEST_1
say  SEQ_CELLAR_MANIFEST_2
flag knows_consignment
